<BRK/>
PMMA Aesthetic Color Finish Base:  Rapid curing, polymethyl methacrylate (PMMA) liquid pigmented resin or combined with PMMA COLOR PACK 
for custom color surfacing. VOC content:  less than 25 g/L.  Color to meet cool roof requirements, or as determined by Contracting Officer.</OLI><BRK/>
